==French==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|frm|mensonge}}, from {{inh|fr|fro|mençonge}}, {{m|fro|mençunge}}, probably from a {{inh|fr|VL.|*mentionica}}, from {{inh|fr|LL.|mentiō|mentiōnem}} (in the sense of "lie" rather than "mention"), probably formed from haplology of a root {{m|la|*mentītiō}}, from {{inh|fr|la|mentītus}}, past participle of {{m|la|mentior}}. Cognate to {{cog|oc|messorga}}, {{m|oc|messonja}}, {{m|oc|mensònega}}; compare also {{cog|it|menzogna}}, {{cog|roa-opt|mensonha}}, {{cog|rm|manzögna}} and {{cog|fro|mensoigne}}, from a different but related root, and {{cog|ro|minciună}}.

